    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "27ebd959_089a7e4c",
        "filename": "pvmfw/src/helpers.rs",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 24,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T10:25:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s pvmfw\u0027s page size, just like the kernel\u0027s `PAGE_SIZE` macro; wouldn\u0027t \"`PVMFW_PAGE_SIZE`\" be unnecessarily verbose?",
      "parentUuid": "708d3c40_fb5cf3a6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 24,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 24,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "843ceb9c50c150a3ae46c701949c4cb926051bd1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7d9323f5_d5a8c2e7",
        "filename": "pvmfw/src/helpers.rs",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 24,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T13:24:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well it seems odd that one is qualified and the other isn\u0027t, and if there is an ambiguity it\u0027s good to be explicit.\nOUR_PAGE_SIZE?\n\nHow could these ever be different?",
      "parentUuid": "27ebd959_089a7e4c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 24,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 24,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "843ceb9c50c150a3ae46c701949c4cb926051bd1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cd487a0b_2fadbc88",
        "filename": "pvmfw/src/helpers.rs",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 24,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T13:35:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The CPU only defines the _set_ of supported page sizes but it\u0027s software that decides which size it uses: pvmfw uses 4KiB but it could boot a kernel that configures the CPU to use another granule.\n\n`OUR_PAGE_SIZE` isn\u0027t very clear, IMO (\"who are _we_?\"); do you want me to rename `PAGE_SIZE` to `PVMFW_PAGE_SIZE`?",
      "parentUuid": "7d9323f5_d5a8c2e7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 24,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 24,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "843ceb9c50c150a3ae46c701949c4cb926051bd1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "31552571_61bf7554",
        "filename": "pvmfw/src/helpers.rs",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 24,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T13:40:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That would be my preference.\n\nIf guest page size could vary, why is it a constant?",
      "parentUuid": "cd487a0b_2fadbc88",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 24,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 24,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "843ceb9c50c150a3ae46c701949c4cb926051bd1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "139d73d5_1c0d127f",
        "filename": "pvmfw/src/helpers.rs",
        "patchSetId": 1
